Branch `green/pending-fees-view`: a harmless change. It adds a view, `AcmeVaultFixed.pendingFees()`, so the
vault's runtime code changes (a new function in its dispatcher) and every paid proof re-runs against the new
code. Expected: the immune memory check passes (exit 0): every paid proof it can read breaks no rule.

Apply: git checkout -b green/pending-fees-view && git apply patches/green-pending-fees-view.patch

diff --git a/src/acme-fixes/AcmeFinalFix.sol b/src/acme-fixes/AcmeFinalFix.sol
--- a/src/acme-fixes/AcmeFinalFix.sol
+++ b/src/acme-fixes/AcmeFinalFix.sol
@@ -50,4 +50,9 @@
         if (from != msg.sender) revert NotYourFunds();
         return _deposit(from, from, assets);
     }
+
+    /// @notice Fees accrued and not yet collected, for dashboards.
+    function pendingFees() external view returns (uint256) {
+        return accruedFees;
+    }
 }
